  "title": "Pasta with Fresh Tomatoes and Corn",
  "description": "Taste a late summer harvest in a colorful pasta sauce that needs no cooking. Simply stir cooked corn, chopped tomatoes and sliced green onions into a dressing of olive oil, red wine vinegar and basil. Toss with hot pasta and sprinkle with Parmesan.",
